            "review_title": "Review at Valhalla Grill",
            "review_text": "Vandergast\nMorelia, Mexico198 contributions\n0\nI think 🤔 the food & service are good.\nOct 2019 • Family\nIn my opinion, the food and service are good. Though, we took the food to go; it didn’t take much to get our order. \n\nStill, the setting is plain and not welcoming; but the food can compensate for that. \n\nThe cheese sticks are really good. I also enjoyed my falafel burger. I didn’t like the chili poppers. The flavor wasn’t bad but the texture was difficult to swallow. When you don’t have the proper chilies, the cooks need to roast the chilies to later peel them. \n\nIf you are not that picky, you’ll enjoy the food. The pull pork burgers are quite good. The meat is so tender and savory.\nRead more\nWritten October 4, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
