            "review_text": "Thomas@TomVoyage\nBangkok, Thailand1059 contributions\n0\nNice Break from Asian Cuisine\nJan 2019 • Couples\nOkay, it's not like the Germans make it, but their Curry Wurst makes a nice change from Asian cuisine.\n\nThey have a selection of 'western dishes', but be forewarned that they are all prepped off premise and reheated from vacuum packs.\n\nDo again? When I need a western Curry fix.\nRead more\nWritten January 23, 2019",
